nk:talk-workshop-10th-workshop-on-automated-knowledge-ba a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "10th Workshop on Automated Knowledge Base Construction (AKBC)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-knowledge-bases,
        nk:topic-llms,
        nk:topic-reasoning-math ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-28 ;
    nk:room "F8" ;
    nk:summary "While Large Language Models (LLMs) have revolutionized NLP, they remain prone to hallucinations, reasoning “mode-collapse” in open-ended generation, and a lack of factual provenance. The Automated Knowledge Base Construction (AKBC) workshop addresses a key missing piece of the generative era: struct" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Wednesday, October 28th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://www.akbc.ws/2026/" .

nk:talk-workshop-10th-workshop-on-online-abuse-and-harms a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "10th Workshop on Online Abuse and Harms (WOAH)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-alignment-safety,
        nk:topic-legal-finance,
        nk:topic-low-resource-languages,
        nk:topic-multilingual-nlp,
        nk:topic-speech-audio ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-29 ;
    nk:room "G12" ;
    nk:summary "Artificial Intelligence (AI) and digital technologies have transformed how people communicate and interact, creating rich societal benefits. At the same time, they have amplified abusive and harmful content, reinforced inequalities, and increased risks to human rights and well-being." ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Thursday, October 29th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://www.thewoah.org/" .

nk:talk-workshop-11th-workshop-on-financial-technology-a a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "11th Workshop on Financial Technology and Natural Language Processing (FinNLP - ACL SIG-FinTech)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-legal-finance,
        nk:topic-llms ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-28 ;
    nk:room "F7" ;
    nk:summary "The FinNLP workshop aims to explore the intersection of Natural Language Processing (NLP), Machine Learning (ML), and Large Language Models (LLMs) within the financial, economics, and legal domains. The goal is to foster interdisciplinary research and innovation, addressing the multifaceted challeng" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Wednesday, October 28th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://sigfintech.github.io/finnlp2026/index.html" .

nk:talk-workshop-11th-workshop-on-natural-user-generated a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "11th Workshop on Natural User-generated Text (W-NUT)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-evaluation,
        nk:topic-llms,
        nk:topic-reasoning-math ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-28 ;
    nk:room "G15-16" ;
    nk:summary "The 11th Workshop on Natural User-generated Text (W-NUT) addresses the evolving challenges at the intersection of noisy, user-generated written content and modern Large Language Models (LLMs). As LLMs are increasingly deployed in real-world applications, they must contend with the messy, informal, a" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Wednesday, October 28th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://noisy-text.github.io/2026" .

nk:talk-workshop-13th-web-as-corpus-workshop-wac-13 a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "13th Web-as-Corpus Workshop (WaC-13)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-documents-web-data,
        nk:topic-evaluation,
        nk:topic-legal-finance,
        nk:topic-low-resource-languages,
        nk:topic-multilingual-nlp ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-29 ;
    nk:room "G6" ;
    nk:summary "The 13th Web-as-Corpus workshop provides a multidisciplinary forum for researchers to address the full life-cycle of web-based data. We invite contributions that introduce or evaluate methodologies for the collection, cleaning, and enrichment of web corpora, as well as their downstream applications " ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Thursday, October 29th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://wackyworkshop.org/" .

nk:talk-workshop-2nd-workshop-on-sign-language-processin a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "2nd Workshop on Sign Language Processing (WSLP 2026)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-evaluation,
        nk:topic-multilingual-nlp,
        nk:topic-multimodal,
        nk:topic-speech-audio ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-29 ;
    nk:room "G11" ;
    nk:summary "Across the world, more than 430 million people experience disabling hearing loss. For many in the Deaf and Hard of Hearing community, sign languages (SL) are the primary means of communication." ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Thursday, October 29th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://exploration-lab.github.io/WSLP-2026/" .

nk:talk-workshop-3rd-workshop-on-natural-language-proces a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "3rd Workshop on Natural Language Processing meets Climate Change (ClimateNLP)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-social-good-climate ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-28 ;
    nk:room "G13-14" ;
    nk:summary "In the past decades, the importance of addressing climate change has been fully adopted by the scientific community. However, complicated dynamics between policy, regulation, industry, and society make it difficult to encourage effective climate action." ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Wednesday, October 28th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://nlp4climate.github.io/" .

nk:talk-workshop-4th-workshop-on-mathematical-natural-la a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "4th Workshop on Mathematical Natural Language Processing (MathNLP)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-evaluation,
        nk:topic-reasoning-math ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-28 ;
    nk:room "F4-5" ;
    nk:summary "The articulation of mathematical arguments is a fundamental part of scientific reasoning and communication. Across many disciplines, expressing relations and interdependencies between quantities is at the centre of scientific argumentation." ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Wednesday, October 28th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://sites.google.com/view/mathnlp2026" .

nk:talk-workshop-5th-workshop-on-nlp-for-positive-impact a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "5th Workshop on NLP for Positive Impact (NLP4PI)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-alignment-safety,
        nk:topic-social-good-climate,
        nk:topic-speech-audio ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-28 ;
    nk:room "G7-8" ;
    nk:summary "The increasing integration of Natural Language Processing (NLP) technologies and systems into daily life opens up various opportunities to drive positive social impact. While much of existing research has focused on detecting and mitigating harm—such as hate speech detection and mitigating misinform" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Wednesday, October 28th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://sites.google.com/view/nlp4positiveimpact" .

nk:talk-workshop-6th-workshop-on-multilingual-representa a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "6th Workshop on Multilingual Representation Learning (associated with SIGTYP) (MRL)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-evaluation,
        nk:topic-multilingual-nlp ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-28 ;
    nk:room "F3" ;
    nk:summary "Despite the importance of research on multilingual NLP topics, there are limited venues for this work. In 2025, across NAACL, ACL, EMNLP, and AACL, the MRL workshop was the only workshop focusing on multilingual NLP broadly, without a focus on a particular region or set of languages." ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Wednesday, October 28th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://sigtyp.github.io/ws2026-mrl.html" .

nk:talk-workshop-accelerating-language-modeling-research a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "Accelerating language modeling research with cognitively plausible datasets (BabyLM)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-cognition-brain,
        nk:topic-evaluation,
        nk:topic-llms,
        nk:topic-multilingual-nlp ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-29 ;
    nk:room "F4-5" ;
    nk:summary "The BabyLM Workshop challenges the bigger-is-better trend in language model (LM) pretraining by providing a venue for the community to focus on small-scale LM training and exploring its connections to human language development. The workshop will invite research related to data-efficient LMs, develo" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Thursday, October 29th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://babylm.github.io/index.html" .

nk:talk-workshop-analyzing-and-interpreting-neural-netwo a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "Analyzing and Interpreting Neural Networks for NLP (BlackboxNLP)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-llms,
        nk:topic-reasoning-math ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-29 ;
    nk:room "P3" ;
    nk:summary "As neural networks, and particularly large language models, have become ubiquitous in NLP research and applications, understanding their behaviors and how they connect to their internal mechanisms has evolved from an academic curiosity to a practical necessity. These models now power critical applic" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Thursday, October 29th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://blackboxnlp.github.io/" .

nk:talk-workshop-eleventh-conference-on-machine-translat a nk:Talk ;
