    nk:room "P2" ;
    nk:summary "This workshop focuses on grounding language models by connecting them to signals beyond text—such as external knowledge, interaction and feedback, perception, and action—to improve both faithfulness (reducing hallucinations, improving verifiability) and learning efficiency. It brings together resear" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
