    nk:summary "The NLLP workshop series explores methods and applications of Natural Language Processing (NLP) for the Legal Domain by focusing on original research on legal data and data with legal relevance. On the one hand, legal text (e.g., case law, legal rules, contracts) has distinct characteristics such as" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Wednesday, October 28th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://nllpw.org/workshop/" .

nk:talk-workshop-pluralistic-ai-nlp-diversity-aware-soci a nk:Talk ;
    rdfs:label "Pluralistic AI & NLP: Diversity-aware, Sociotechnical and Responsible Alignment (PANDORA)" ;
    nk:about nk:topic-alignment-safety ;
    nk:inSession nk:session-workshops-29 ;
    nk:room "G13-14" ;
    nk:summary "The PANDORA workshop explores methods, applications, and normative discussions around diversity-aware, sociotechnical, and responsible alignment of NLP technologies. We position pluralism as a core sociotechnical design principle and aim to unite researchers from NLP, AI safety, and related fields." ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Thursday, October 29th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://pandora-workshop.github.io/" .

nk:talk-workshop-second-workshop-for-research-on-agent-l a nk:Talk ;
