    nk:summary "DocInsights focuses on advancing document understanding beyond plain text by centering structured, semi-structured, and multimodal documents in NLP research. Real-world documents in domains such as law, finance, healthcare, science, and government interleave free-form language with tables, forms, ch" ;
    nk:talkType "Workshop" ;
    nk:time "Thursday, October 29th 9:00–17:30" ;
    nk:url "https://docinsights-workshop.github.io/docinsights-2026/" .

nk:talk-workshop-workshop-on-open-reasoning-across-cultu a nk:Talk ;
